            "message": "<style>\r\n.helpful { padding: 0 0 10px; }\r\n.helpful h4 { margin: 20px 0 10px; font-size: 1.3em; line-height: 1.2; }\r\n.helpful h4:first-child { margin-top: -5px; }\r\n.helpful h5 { margin: 20px 0 10px; font-size: 1.1em; }\r\n.helpful h5:first-child { margin-top: -.5rem; }\r\n.helpful p { opacity: .6; margin: 15px 0px; }\r\n<\/style>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"helpful\">\r\n\r\n<h4>Buttons<\/h4>\r\n<code>[button label=\"\" type=\"\" wpid=\"\" url=\"\" target=\"\" id=\"\" class=\"\" style=\"\"]<\/code>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<strong>label<\/strong> = text inside button<br>\r\n<strong>type<\/strong> = <em>default, light, forward, back, alt, alt-light<\/em><br>\r\n<strong>wpid<\/strong> = ID of Wordpress page<br>\r\n<strong>url<\/strong> = URL link instead of <em>wpid<\/em><br>\r\n<strong>target<\/strong> = <em>_blank<\/em> to open new page<br>\r\n<strong>id<\/strong> = CSS ID<br>\r\n<strong>class<\/strong> = CSS class(es)<br>\r\n<strong>style<\/strong> = Inline CSS\r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\n<h4><em>Gravity Forms<\/em> Form<\/h4>\r\n<code>[gravityform id=\"1\" title=\"false\" description=\"false\" ajax=\"true\"]<\/code><br>\r\n<strong>id<\/strong> = ID of Gravity Forms form<br>\r\n<a href=\"https:\/\/docs.gravityforms.com\/shortcodes\/\" target=\"_blank\">More info<\/a>\r\n\r\n<h4>Permanent URL<\/h4>\r\n<code>[url wpid='']<\/code><br>\r\n<strong>wpid<\/strong> = ID of Wordpress page\/post\/event\r\n<br><br>\r\nExample: <code>[url wpid='324']<\/code> would generate a the full URL to the About page\r\n<\/div>",
            "new_lines": "",
            "esc_html": 0
        },
