            "message": "<div class=\"helpful\">\r\n\r\n<h4>To prevent words from wrapping...<\/h4>\r\n<p>Be sure to use these only within the \"Text\" tab of the editor<\/p>\r\n\r\n<h5>By adding \"&amp;nbsp;\" between two&nbsp;words:<\/h5>\r\n<p>Careful, may go off screen on mobile if too wide.<\/p>\r\n<code>Title of Section and Let's Keep Last Two Words&amp;nbsp;Together<\/code>\r\n\r\n<h5>By wrapping in &lt;span&gt; tag with \"md-nowrap\":<\/h5>\r\n<p>md- limits it to larger screens, or use just \"nowrap\" for all screens (but may go offscreen on mobile if too wide)<\/p>\r\n<code>&lt;h5&gt;Meet our new staff member &lt;span class=\"md-nowrap\">Becky Beckerson&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/h5&gt;<\/code>\r\n\r\n<\/div>",
